    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170418072120/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13123926.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "公開されました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "公开了！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "has been released."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "それにあわせて公式HPも春の模様替えです˚✧₊⁎❝᷀ົཽ≀ˍ̮ ❝᷀ົཽ⁎⁺˳✧༚"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "配合着这件事，官方网站也换上了春天的装扮。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Along with it, the official website has had a spring makeover too ˚✧₊⁎❝᷀ົཽ≀ˍ̮ ❝᷀ົཽ⁎⁺˳✧༚"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "4月から放送のTVアニメ「ソード・オラトリア ダンジョンに出会いを求めるのは間違っているだろうか 外伝」のED主題歌になっている5月24日発売の「day by day/鹿乃」のCD情報が詳しく載っているので是非チェックしてみてくださいね。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "4月起开播的电视动画《剑姬神圣谭 在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么 外传》的片尾主题歌——5月24日发售的《day by day/鹿乃》这张CD，相关信息都详细刊登在上面了，大家一定要去看看哦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It has detailed CD information for \"day by day / Kano\", out May 24, the ending theme of the TV anime \"Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? On the Side: Sword Oratoria\" airing from April, so please check it out."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "card",
        "title": "鹿乃 Warner Bros. Home Entertainment Official Website",
        "url": "http://whv-amusic.com/kano/sp/",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170418072120/http://whv-amusic.com/kano/sp/"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "※一応補足ですが今回公開されたものはアーティスト写真であって、ジャケット写真ではありません。ジャケット写真はもーちょっとあとにお披露目です！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "※稍微补充一下：这次公开的是艺人写真，不是封面照哦。封面照还要再稍等一阵子才会亮相！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "※Just to be clear, what was released this time is the artist photo, not the jacket photo. The jacket photo will be revealed a bit later!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2017年もこんな感じで慣れないことばかりが続きそうな年だあ。鹿乃のレベル1な心が折れないように元気をいっぱい、みんなの笑顔や言葉でわけてください。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "2017年看来也会是这样满是陌生事物的一年呀。为了不让鹿乃这颗等级1的小心脏碎掉，请把大家的笑容和话语化作满满的元气分给我吧。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It looks like 2017 will be another year full of unfamiliar things. So that my level-1 heart doesn't break, please share lots of energy with me through your smiles and words."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "甘えさせろーーー！笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "让我撒个娇嘛——！笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Let me be spoiled!! lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "なんてね。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "开玩笑的啦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Just kidding."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ではでは、鹿乃でした(о´∀`о)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么那么，我是鹿乃，就先这样啦(о´∀`о)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Well then, that was Kano(о´∀`о)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
